  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Asia Subregional Economic Cooperation Customs and Logistics Reforms Program (Subprogram 1)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed program will support continuing reforms in customs through implementation of the Customs Reform and Modernization (CRM) Plan 2021-2026 and improving trade logistics through the preparation and implementation of a new Trade Logistics Policy (TLP) 2022.</narrative>
